{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56885","headline":"武德二年江东童谣（以下谣） · 佚名","name":"武德二年江东童谣（以下谣）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江水何泠泠，杨柳何青青。\n人今正好乐，已复戍彭城。\n（见唐赵蕤《长短经》卷四《霸图》）（〖1〗《长短经》：「大唐武德二年，王充杀越王侗於洛阳，僭称尊号，随氏灭矣。\n」注云：「今兹三月江东童谣曰〖略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56885.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56885","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}